  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ukama Ustawi: climate resilient mixed-maize agribusiness ecosystems in East and Southern Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This regional programme will identify, leverage and accelerate policies, practices, technologies, and services for climate-smart innovations in maize-growing areas of Eastern and Southern Africa. It has a focus on climate change adaptation.</narrative>
  </description>
